### 5.3 `backend/brokers/angelone/Angel_WS.js`

**Purpose:** WebSocket connection to Angel One SmartAPI stream.

**Key exports:**

| Function | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `startWS({ apiKey, clientCode, feedToken, tokens, onTick, onDisconnect })` | Connect + subscribe |
| `stopWS()` | Close connection |
| `resubscribe(tokens)` | Change subscribed tokens |
| `getWSStatus()` | `{ running, connected, connectedAt, lastTickMs, tokenCount }` |

**Behavior:**
- Connects to `wss://smartapisocket.angelone.in/smart-stream`
- Sends subscribe message (mode 1 = LTP) for all tokens
- Heartbeat ping every 25 sec
- Auto-reconnect on drop (3 sec delay)
- Fires `onTick(token, ltp)` on every tick
- Fires `onDisconnect(gapStart, gapEnd)` on connection loss

